{"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/afluent\/passthroughsubject"]}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"final"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"class"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"PassthroughSubject"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"genericParameter","text":"Element"},{"kind":"text","text":"> "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"where"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Element"},{"kind":"text","text":" : "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:s8SendableP","text":"Sendable"}],"platforms":["macOS"],"languages":["swift"]}]},{"content":[{"anchor":"Subscribing","level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Subscribing"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A consumer subscribes when its iterator is created, which is when a "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"for try await"},{"type":"text","text":" loop over the subject"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"(or over an operator chain built on it) begins. From then on, every value sent is buffered for that consumer"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"until it is consumed, so a consumer that is slower than the sender still sees every value, in order."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Values sent while there are no subscribers are discarded; they are never replayed to a later consumer."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"name":"Important","type":"aside","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Starting a ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Task"},{"text":" that iterates the subject does not mean it has subscribed yet. If values must","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"not be missed, wait until the consumer has subscribed before sending, for example with","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"handleEvents(receiveMakeIterator:)"},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"style":"important"},{"anchor":"Example","level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Example"},{"code":["let subject = PassthroughSubject<Int>()","let subscribed = SingleValueSubject<Void>()","","subject.send(0) \/\/ No subscribers yet, so this value is discarded.","","Task {","    for try await value in subject.handleEvents(receiveMakeIterator: { try? subscribed.send() }) {","        print(\"Received value: \\(value)\") \/\/ prints 1, then 2","    }","}","","try await subscribed.execute()","subject.send(1)","subject.send(2)","subject.send(completion: .finished)"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift"}],"kind":"content"}],"metadata":{"symbolKind":"class","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"PassthroughSubject","kind":"identifier"}],"role":"symbol","remoteSource":{"fileName":"PassthroughSubject.swift","url":"https:\/\/github.com\/Tyler-Keith-Thompson\/Afluent\/blob\/main\/Sources\/Afluent\/PassthroughSubject.swift#L41"},"fragments":[{"text":"class","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"PassthroughSubject","kind":"identifier"}],"externalID":"s:7Afluent18PassthroughSubjectC","title":"PassthroughSubject","roleHeading":"Class","modules":[{"name":"Afluent"}]},"sections":[],"kind":"symbol","identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/PassthroughSubject","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent"]]},"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"major":0,"patch":0},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A subject that broadcasts values to multiple consumers without storing a current value."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Unlike "},{"code":"CurrentValueSubject","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"code":"PassthroughSubject","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" does not retain the most recent value."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"This is an "},{"code":"AsyncSequence","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" that allows multiple tasks to a